  "description": "Welcome to Villa Botanica, a truly unique 5-bedroom, 5-bathroom villa that perfectly blends modern luxury with the peaceful atmosphere of a nature-inspired retreat. Designed for unforgettable stays with family and friends, this exceptional property offers privacy, space, and an incredible connection to the outdoors while still delivering every modern comfort.\n\nThe villa is thoughtfully designed across separate living areas, making it ideal for large families or groups travelling together. Both the upper and lower floors feature their own living room, kitchen, and bedrooms, allowing guests to enjoy both shared moments and personal privacy. The fifth bedroom and bathroom are located in a separate private guest house outside the main villa, making it perfect for teenagers, grandparents, staff, or anyone wanting additional independence.\n\nSurrounded by lush greenery, the garden feels like a private oasis filled with fruit trees, herbs, and Mediterranean charm. Guests can wander through banana and mango trees, pick fresh mint or lavender, and enjoy the calming atmosphere created by the villa’s natural surroundings. Free-roaming chickens add to the authentic retreat experience, and guests can even collect fresh eggs from the chicken coop in the morning.\n\nOutdoor living is at the heart of Villa Botanica. The property features an impressive outdoor kitchen complete with a BBQ and pizza oven, perfect for long evenings dining under the Spanish sky. Multiple terraces around the house and garden provide beautiful spaces to relax, sunbathe, or enjoy quiet moments throughout the day.\n\nThe villa also offers a stunning infinity pool with optional heating, a jacuzzi, private gym, and sauna, creating the ultimate luxury wellness experience within your own private sanctuary.\n\nVilla Botanica is more than just a holiday home — it is a one-of-a-kind retreat where modern comfort, nature, and relaxed luxury come together to create an unforgettable Costa del Sol experience.\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a bit more about yourself and the group that you will be travelling with so we can request this for you.",
